# ABP Suite

ABP Suite is a tool for generating CRUD pages and entities.

## Features
- Generate entities with properties
- Generate application services
- Generate DTOs
- Generate UI pages (MVC, Blazor, Angular)
- Generate database migrations
- Master-detail relationships
- Many-to-many relationships

## Generated Code Structure
Suite generates code following ABP best practices:
- Entity in Domain layer
- Repository interface in Domain layer
- Repository implementation in EF Core/MongoDB layer
- App service interface in Application.Contracts
- App service implementation in Application
- DTOs in Application.Contracts
- UI pages/components in Web/Blazor/Angular

## Customization
- Edit Razor templates for custom code generation
- Override generated code patterns
